OL,3,GNEWSAPupils' Bayeux Tapestry visit
OL,4,A'once in a lifetime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchoolchildren from East Sussex have
OL,7,Fbeen given an "experience they will
OL,8,Fnever forget" with an exclusive first
OL,9,Flook at the Bayeux Tapestry in London.
OL,11,FDozens of students from both sides of
OL,12,Fthe Channel were invited to the British
OL,13,FMuseum on 2 September to see the nearly
OL,14,F1,000-year-old tapestry.
OL,16,FThey also got to meet King Charles III,
OL,17,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham and French
OL,18,FPresident Emmanuel Macron.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
