OL,3,GNEWSAPupils' Bayeux Tapestry visit
OL,4,A'once in a lifetime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe early medieval masterpiece, which
OL,7,Ftells the story of the events leading
OL,8,Fup to 1066 and the Norman Conquest, is
OL,9,Fopen to the public from next week until
OL,10,F11 July next year.
